# Consolidated author identities (F-031).
#
# One contributor appears under three names and two addresses, because git fell back to
# the machine name on hosts with no user.name configured and to the GitHub account name
# on others. A .mailmap is a display-only mapping: it changes what git log, shortlog and
# blame show without rewriting a single commit, which matters because the audit may not
# rewrite history.
#
# Canonical identity first, then each variant.
